that do not serve commercial purposes.

Non-commercial means not directed toward direct or indirect commercial
advantage or monetary compensation. User identity or the absence of a sale
alone does not make a use non-commercial.

Retain this license, copyright notice and safety disclaimer in copies and
distributions. Identify modified copies as modified. Recipients receive rights
to the Covered Material under these same terms; modification or distribution
does not grant commercial rights. Ownership remains with the respective rights
holders; no ownership transfer or trademark permission is granted.

3. Commercial use requires a separate agreement

All commercial use of the Covered Material is prohibited under this license,
including selling software or copies; use in for-profit projects or services;
internal enterprise production or operations; and deployment, integration or
operation for commercial customers, even without a separate software charge.

Before such use, contact the author at __CONTACT_EMAIL__ and obtain a signed
commercial license covering that use. An inquiry or download is not commercial
authorization. See COMMERCIAL_LICENSE.md. This requirement applies to use
under this license and is subject to the scope in Section 1.

